OL,3,GNEWSAWomen welcome annual check for
OL,4,Adebilitating condition
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Neelam Heera-Shergill was
OL,7,Fdiagnosed with polycystic ovary
OL,8,Fsyndrome (PCOS) at the age of 18, she
OL,9,Ffeared it could one day stop her
OL,10,Fbecoming a mother.
OL,12,F"I'm never going to have children.
OL,13,FThat's it, my life is over," she said.
OL,15,FThe condition affects about one in
OL,16,Feight women in the UK, yet despite its
OL,17,Fbroad impact on health and wellbeing,
OL,18,FNeelam, from Birmingham, said she was
OL,19,Fleft with little understanding of what
OL,20,Fher diagnosis really meant.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
