OL,3,GNEWSAWomen welcome annual check for
OL,4,Adebilitating condition
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is one of the reasons she supports
OL,7,Fthe decision to rename PCOS to
OL,8,Fpolyendocrine metabolic ovarian
OL,9,Fsyndrome (PMOS) earlier this year,
OL,10,Falongside a recommendation for annual
OL,11,Fhealth checks to improve diagnosis and
OL,12,Flong-term care.
